scope: |
  UniFront.param never sets byName, so on the UniML front a by-name argument is
  evaluated EAGERLY and the semantics are silently lost. Invisible to both gates:
  front-diff omits the flag from its text, and the capability gate sees both fronts
  ACCEPT. Set it in the projection, and print it so the differential can see it.
next: set byName from the TypeRef text, print it, verify once the front compiles
